WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:05.720
I activate the other effect of the "Rising Hope" equipped to Hope!

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:10.700
Hope can use the Overlay Units using the effects of Numeron Dragon and Abyss Splash.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:12.920
What?

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:17.770
The effects of all your other monsters are combined in Hope!?

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:20.830
Here goes, Don Thousand!

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:24.050
<i>"End of Chaos - The Deadly Final Hope Sword Slash!!"</i>

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.500
I detach 1 Overlay Unit from Hope

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.720
to activate the effect of "Numeron Dragon"!

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.250
Kaito, lend me your strength.

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.320
Once per turn,

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:34.850
it's ATK will increase by all the Xyz Monsters on the field's...

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:37.800
... combined Rank multiplied with 1000!

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.150
The combined Ranks of the Xyz Monsters from both fields is 23.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:48.400
Thus, Hope's Attack rises to 25500!

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.960
So it gained Attack?

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:58.420
But that still falls leagues short of my Numerronius Numerronia's 100,000 Attack.

00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:02.870
I'm not done yet! Hope still has Overlay Units!

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:06.300
We detach one of Hope's Overlay Units...

00:01:06.350 --> 00:01:08.680
... to activate Abyss Splash's effect!

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:10.980
By using an Overlay Unit,

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:14.700
the monster's Attack doubles until the battle ends.

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:18.990
I use both of the Overlay Units attached to Hope,

00:01:19.150 --> 00:01:21.860
to quadruple Hope's Attack.

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:26.050
That's 102,000 Attack!

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:30.830
You did it, guys! Hope's Attack is higher!

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:35.220
Hope, attack Numerronius Numerronia!

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:37.270
How foolish.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.660
I activate the effect of my Numerronius Numerronia.

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:43.350
By using one Chaos Overlay Unit,

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:47.150
it can negate the attack of an opponent's monster!

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:52.800
And then the amount of Attack of the monster that attacked...

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.500
is added to my life points!

00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:59.980
His life is over 100,000... That's...

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:01.500
Do you understand?

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:05.200
No matter what you do, you cannot reach the power of a god.

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:07.970
Are you sure about that?

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:09.470
What?!

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:13.300
Our ray of hope hasn't been extinguished yet!

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:16.400
This is the power of our bonds.

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:20.250
This is the power of believing in others.

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:22.070
It... it can't be...

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:25.820
This is our final hope!

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:29.500
Quick-Play Spell Card "Double Up Chance", activate!

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:34.750
This card will, when one monster's attack is negated,

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:37.500
double that Monster's Attack

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:40.020
and lets it attack once again.

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:44.810
Impossible! It has <i>204,000</i> Attack!?

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:50.550
Go, Hope! Attack Numerronius Numerronia!

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:55.500
Hope fights along side the power of our bonds, this is the power of the King of Wishes.

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:57.520
Now behold...!

00:02:57.520 --> 00:03:01.300
The Clinching Blow, Final Hope Sword Slash!

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:30.900
You did it!

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:33.550
Yuma and you guys beat him!

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:36.800
We beat... Don Thousand...

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:39.950
Kaito...

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:49.100
You saved us, Kaito.

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:55.570
The Dimensional Gateway to the Astral World is closing!

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:00.070
Yuma, turn around.

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:06.270
It seems like the Fusion between Earth and the Barian World has been stopped...

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:10.300
It can't be...

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:14.600
I... I was <i>defeated</i>...?!

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:17.250
Don Thousand!

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:21.370
Your scheme has completely failed!

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:32.900
Even with my destruction, my true curse has not yet been lifted.

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:36.100
You all will soon understand.

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:41.900
Chaos, you realize, is the source of life itself, Chaos is infinite.

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:45.350
Nasch, you get it, don't you?

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:55.700
Wh... what? What's going on?

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.420
Sha... Shark!

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:04.670
Yuma... Astral...

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:08.070
I can't afford to let you two get these Numbers!

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:10.770
Shark, you...?

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:21.410
{marker}

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:25.590
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:30.830
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:42.520
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:46.700
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:53.520
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:57.500
the feelings I want to express.

00:06:00.430 --> 00:06:06.520
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:09.770
Right now, with you

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:13.700
Oh - By facing each other,

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:20.780
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:25.880
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:31.310
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:36.480
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:46.060
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.440
Th... that's...

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:04.230
Astral,

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.110
that world over there... it can't be...!

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.240
The Astral World!?

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.740
Why is the Astral World...?

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.120
And our world's over there!

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:27.340
But it's still fused with the Barian World!

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:28.630
What's goin' on?

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.510
I thought we saved the world...

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:37.520
No. Earth and the Barian World are completely merged.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:42.060
This is a place between that world and the Astral World.

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:43.440
Shark...

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:45.900
Right now, the two worlds are pulling at each other.

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:50.150
If things keep going, the two worlds will collide

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:52.910
and the Astral World will be destroyed.

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:58.580
Wha- what do you mean?
Even though we defeated Don Thousand?

00:07:58.910 --> 00:07:59.830
Also, you...!?

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.500
Shark, it can't be... you...

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:06.790
Yes... because I inherited Don Thousand's power.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.420
Tha... that's... but why?

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:14.050
Don Thousand was our enemy, right?

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:17.640
Have you forgotten? I'm a Barian Warrior.

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:20.430
I am your enemy!

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:26.360
The Astral World was created by all the souls of the universe that desired to Rank Up.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:31.190
But in trying to do so, they threw away all the 'bad' about them.

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:36.160
That was the "Chaos", and that made the Barian World expand.

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:41.160
To be blunt, my world is a collection of their table scraps.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:45.670
But, I cannot abandon the Barian World.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:48.340
All my other friends are in that world.

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.210
Irreplaceable friends!

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:51.380
Shark...!

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:53.260
Even so, we-!

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:54.010
Yuma!

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:58.100
Astral's mission is to use the Numeron Code

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:01.560
and extinguish the Barian World.

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:06.350
But both worlds can just coexist together, for sure!

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.360
That's impossible!

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:10.980
If both worlds would become one,

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:15.070
the Astral World with its weakened power would completely disappear.

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:19.780
We can only have one path or the other, where one world or the other survives!

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:21.370
Then, Shark...!

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:25.210
Did we fight all the way to have everything end like this?

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.210
This is our fate.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:30.500
I won't accept that!

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:33.300
Because, me, you, and everyone...

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:36.380
... I believe we all will understand each other one day, for sure!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:37.890
... I know!

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:41.720
That's because you still haven't broken free of Don Thousand's spell!

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:45.640
Sure it might be his curse...

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:50.060
But, that spell can never be completely broken.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:56.030
Don Thousand interfered with the lives of the other Seven Emperors and altered their memories.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:59.410
But he didn't do anything to me.

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:03.160
With the manipulation of the people close to me

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:08.040
I was led to chose to be a Barian of my own will.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.830
Your own will?

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:16.590
I chose the path on my own will and I charge down that path no matter what.

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:20.720
Even though the friendship with you guys, tries to hinder it,

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.680
I will never forsake the Barians!

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:25.350
The true curse that guy was talking about

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:28.310
it is my very existence...!

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:30.350
Tha... that's...!

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.940
Your friend, Shark... Kamishiro Ryouga,

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:38.030
when I decided to be a Barian, he died!

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:42.370
Now, let's settle things once and for all!
Let's duel!

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:44.410
Shark!

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:46.160
Yuma, let's Duel!

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:47.450
Astral?!

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:48.750
Let's find out!

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:52.330
The answer you are seeking is in this Duel.

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:54.460
Astral...

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:58.220
That's how it always has been for us.

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:02.850
Got it! Let's do it!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:06.850
Here we go, Yuma, Astral!

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:10.100
Yeah! Duel Disk, Set!

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:18.030
D-Gazer, Set!

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:22.950
Duel!

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:26.990
I'll go first! My turn, draw!

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:31.580
Spell Card activate! "Cards Descended from Creation of Ascension"!

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:35.290
By sending a monster from my hand to the Graveyard,

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:38.460
this card lets me add a "Rank-Up-Magic" from my Deck to my hand!

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:41.340
The one I added is this card!

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:45.260
I activate "Rank-Up-Magic The Seventh One"!

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:50.770
Show yourself! Number 101!

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:56.190
And now, Ark Knight is infused with Chaos, and Ranks Up!

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:58.610
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:03.700
Show yourself, Chaos Number 101!

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:06.280
Silent Honors Dark Knight!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:11.160
And now I Normal Summon "Doppel Shark"!

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.960
When this card is successfully Normal Summoned,

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:18.750
I can target a WATER Monster I control,

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:21.920
and "Doppel Shark" becomes that monster!

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:24.430
I chose my Dark Knight!

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:27.430
Doppel Shark becomes Dark Knight!

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:33.100
And the monster selected with this effect

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:36.020
can attack my opponent directly every turn.

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:41.570
Next, I activate the Spell Card "Chaos Cross Barrier"!

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:45.110
When I control two of the same "Chaos" monster,

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:48.410
those monsters cannot be targeted for attacks,

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.910
and neither be destroyed nor banished by effects.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.410
This is bad, Yuma...

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:58.090
If things stay as they are, he'll attack us directly every turn for 2800 damage.

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:03.010
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:06.510
Astral...

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:11.430
Will we really find an answer in this Duel?

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:12.930
Yuma...

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:17.480
Really find a future where we can save everyone...?

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.860
Yuma... Astral...

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:26.160
Yuma, there is a way to solve all our problems.

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:27.160
Hu?

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:28.990
The Numeron Code.

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:30.950
The Numeron Code?

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:37.080
The one who wins this Duel can rewrite the past and future,

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:39.210
he will be the owner of the Numeron Code.

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:43.590
No way, with it one can rewrite all the history!?

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:48.300
That's right, everything that's happened up to now can all be undone, as if it never happened.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:53.020
Sure, if I use the power of the Numeron Code...

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:56.640
then I might be able to save everyone who was killed in this fight...

00:13:57.640 --> 00:14:01.610
But, Astral, is that our real future?

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:04.780
No matter how tough or painful...

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:07.610
we fought our hardest and never ran away...

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:09.780
stacking moment on moment...

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:12.280
would we have a future without all that?

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.080
That's right...

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:18.620
that's just not the future we were fighting to grab!

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:23.670
That's right... That's true, Yuma.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:25.760
There's no value in such a future.

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:27.420
Astral!

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:31.220
My former self would have used the Numeron Code without a hesitation.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.720
But now, I'm...

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.930
... I'm not sure if I would or not...

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:40.060
That's why we're dueling.

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:43.690
This Duel is going to be my <i>"Bring it to 'em"</i>!

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:45.280
<i>"Bring it to 'em"</i>?

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.190
Correct.

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:50.490
We'll definitely be able to find out things by dueling with Shark!

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:55.290
Astral... If you'll find it with <i>"Bring it to 'em"</i>,

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:56.910
then I sure will do it!

00:14:56.910 --> 00:15:00.080
This is my <i>"Bring it to 'em"</i>! My turn!

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:02.380
Draw!

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:05.050
Let's go, Yuma!

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:06.380
Yeah!

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:09.380
I Special Summon "Bunbun Seven"!

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:12.550
If my opponent controls an Xyz Monster,

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:14.720
I can Special Summon this guy from my hand!

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:18.100
Next, I Normal Summon my "Gagaga Magician"!

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:23.770
Once per turn, this monster's Level can be changed to any Level between 1 and 8!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:27.440
I'll make Gagaga Magician Level 7!

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:33.740
I Overlay my Level 7 "Bunbun Seven" and "Gagaga Magician"!

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:35.700
Xyz Summon!

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:41.540
Show yourself, Number 11! "Big Eye"!

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:45.170
I activate the effect of "Big Eye"!

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:48.420
Once per turn, I can use one Overlay Unit,

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:51.430
to take control of an opponent's monster!

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:54.090
I take control of "Dark Knight"!

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:58.520
But, during a turn Big Eye uses this effect, it can't battle.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:01.890
I activate Dark Knight's effect!

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:05.190
Once per turn, it can take one opponent's monster

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.480
and make it into it's own Chaos Overlay Unit!

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:13.110
Now, let's go! Dark Knight, attack him directly!

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:24.170
I figured you two would do something like that.

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:25.210
What?!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:28.960
That was the pain to pay to assemble the Numbers of the Seven Emperors.

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:29.710
Hu?!

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:32.970
Trap Card activate! "The Greatest Duo of the Seven Emperors"!!

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:37.260
When I'm attacked by a Chaos Number and suffer battle damage,

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:41.180
I can Special Summon these two from my Extra Deck!

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:45.770
Come, Chaos Number 102: Noble Daemon!

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:49.270
Chaos Number 103: Ragna Infinity!

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:52.860
But all their effects are negated!

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:56.450
It's a card that directly supports the Over Hundreds!

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:59.450
So he read our moves that far ahead!?

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:02.910
I set a card and end my turn!

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:05.040
My turn...!

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.130
...Draw!

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:10.960
<i>Let's do it, Durbe! Merag!</i>

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:19.100
I'll have Ragna Infinity attack Big Eye!

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:31.320
Then Noble Daemon attacks Dark Knight!

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:42.410
At this moment, my Dark Knight's effect activates.

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:46.370
When this card is destroyed while it has Chaos Overlay Units,

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:49.750
it's Special Summon to my side of the field!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:54.920
And then, the amount of Dark Knight's Attack

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:58.050
is added to my life!

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.760
Shark's Life Points increased!

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:04.680
Dark Knight, attack him directly!

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:05.640
Yuma!

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:06.480
Sure!

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:10.520
I Special Summon "Gagaga Gardna" from my hand!

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:15.320
When I'd get hit by a direct attack, I can Special Summon this card from my hand!

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:25.200
Yuma! Astral!

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:29.750
I set 1 card and end my turn.

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:34.210
I'm not done yet.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:37.420
Because we still haven't found our answer!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:39.640
My turn, draw!

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:42.350
I Normal Summon "Gagaga Kaiser"!

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:51.230
And if there is a "Gagaga" monster on m field,

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:54.400
